.DS_Store
.idea
tmp

# Real configuration and every backup of it. The pattern matters as much as the
# plain name: a .env.back or .env.2026-08-03 left behind while reorganising is
# still a file full of credentials, and only .env itself was covered before.
# .env.example is the tracked template and is re-included below.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Bucket-scoped token file. Only config/tokens.template.json is tracked.
config/tokens.json
config/tokens-*.json
